Subject: [PATCH 14/20] dt-bindings: iommu: qcom: Add the MSM8226 GPU instance

Original integration rationale and historical observations follow. These
observations do not qualify hardware on this refreshed base.

Document the MSM8226 GPU IOMMU and allow the optional translation unit
clock that the driver already requests as "tbu". The MSM8226 GPU SMMU
needs the GPU core clock while its registers are programmed.

Original integration AI credit: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>.

Refreshed from integration source
ca397d0f4501ab85eeab906fd9b49527566f6bd9. Current-base adaptation and
host qualification used OpenAI Codex. Human review and new DCO
certification remain pending.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
index 8e6979893..fb59945c2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/qcom,iommu.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,msm8976-iommu
           - const: qcom,msm-iommu-v2
       - enum:
+          - qcom,msm8226-gpu-iommu
           - qcom,msm8226-mdp-iommu
           - qcom,msm8974-gpu-iommu
           - qcom,msm8974-mdp-iommu
